4.7 Study 2 Discussion
This results of this experiment found that performing an NDRT was detrimental to situational awareness, regardless of the presentation method. This was also refected in the lower confdence and attention ratings for each of the NDRT presentation conditions, although confdence ratings were signifcantly higher in the Dynamic AR HUD condition compared to the AR HDD condition. Notably,

